+# Billing disputes
+
+Billing support distinguishes refund requests from invoice questions. The billing classifier routes messages containing `refund` to `refund-review` and other billing questions to `invoice-question`.
+
+A refund classification starts a review; it does not establish approval, amount, or payment timing. Invoice answers must stay within the facts available in the request or project evidence and identify missing information rather than inventing invoice details.

